
STM8S103F3P6 Hardware Abstraction Layer
    ==============================

This repository is a self-made HAL for the STM8S103F3P6.

Tools
-----

* Language : C90, AVR Assembly (for practice), LaTeX
* Compilier : SDCC (Small Device C Compilier) with pedantics flags
* Build : Makefile, program ST-LINK V2, stm8sflash software, clang-format
* Checker : Cppcheck with addon MISRA C:2012
* Text Editor : Emacs
* Coding Style : Allman


What implemented?
-----------------

* Documentation - docs/
* Custom assertions - error.h
* General purpose input/output - gpio.h
* Serial peripheral interface - spi.h
* Universal Asynchronous Receiver-Transmitter - uart.h

